{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36848","headline":"寄黔中王从事 · 罗隐","name":"寄黔中王从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人刀笔事军书，南转黔江半月余。\n别後乡关情几许，近来诗酒兴何如。\n贪将醉袖矜莺谷，不把瑶缄附鲤鱼。\n今日举觞君莫问，生涯牢落鬓萧疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}